    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saolo Yaguuta Avandu va Amoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyima wu mweli mulala Saolo niyakagwa umwami, Nahashi mwami wa Amoni yimilira liihi lilie kuzia kulwaana lidaala lia Yabeshi mu kivala cha Gileadi kandi naalikumbiriza. Avasaza vosi va Yabeshi vavoolera Nahashi, “Lomba lilagana ni kunyi, na kunyi kulakuvugilira kuli mwami wiitu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa Nahashi yativura, “Ndalomba lilagana ni munyi niiva muvugiliraa mbuduli emoni yu mundu woosi yu mukono mulungi nandio ndaleta zisoni ku vandu va Isiraeli vosi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aviimiliri va Yabeshi vamuvolera, “Okohe uvwiyangu vwa madiku saba kutumi avatumwa mu kivala choosi cha Isiraeli. Niiva sihalava nu mulala ohonyia kunyi, ahene yaho kuliihaana ku ivi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avatumwa vaduuka ha Gibea, aha Saolo yamenyaa, na lwa vavoola amakuva yaga, avandu vosi vatanga kulira ni vakuzi mioyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saolo yaali niyazaa kutura mu mulimi ni zing'ombe ziukulima. Yateeva, “Ni ki chekoleki? Kigira ki mundu woosi aliraa?” Vamuvolera makuva ga vatumwa kutura Yabeshi vaali nivavooye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa Saolo yahulira amakuva yaga, Roho wa Nyasaye yaza kuye nizinguru zinene ligali muno; kandi uvutima vwivwe vwaka ligali kuli muliru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yavugula zing'ombe ziukulima ziviri, naazitemanyia mu vidonye kandi natuma vatumwa mu kivala choosi cha Isiraeli ni lieganihiza yili, “Ku vosi utalonda Saolo na Samweli mu vulwani zing'ombe ziukulima zizie zilakolerwa yaga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avandu va Isiraeli vaatia icha Yahova anyala kokora, kandi vosi, vugira mulala kutigala, vazaa harara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saolo yaavavungiza ha Bezeki; vaali ho avasaza 300,000 kutura Isiraeli, kandi avasaza 30,000 kutura Ivuyuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vavoolera vatumwa kutura Yabeshi, “Vooleri avandu vinyu ndi mugamba nivukiri kuduuka mbasu hagati, valava nivasooleywi.” Lwa vandu va Yabeshi vanyoola amakuva yaga, vasangala ligali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunangwa vaavoolera Nahashi, “Mugamba kulaaza kwihana ku ivi, na ivi unyala kokora ku kunyi choosi cha olola kuva kilahi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vudiku yivwo Saolo yagavula vasaza vukulwaana veve mu viduma vivaga; kandi mugambazuri mumavwevwe, vazia zimbiru mu hokososa ha vasigu kandi niyingilira avandu va Amoni. Kuduuka mbasu hagati vaali nivaviiti. Avaari nivahononoki, musaza sa mulala niyirukaa ku vwivwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku avandu va Isiraeli vavoolera Samweli, “Vaveeye haliha vandu vavoola ndi Saolo sialava mwami wiitu? Vahane ku kunyi, na kunyi kulaviita!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa Saolo yavoola, “Sihaveeyeho nu mundu unyala kwitwa kalunu mba, kigira lidiku yili, Yahova umali kosoola Isiraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Samweli yavavolera, “Gendi kwosi kwirane Giligali lwa kaviri kulandizi mwami Saolo kuli mwami wiitu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunangwa avandu vosi vazia Giligali, na uwene yeyo havundu Hatakatifu zana, valandiza Saolo kuva mwami. Vaahana visiuviliru vie mirembe imbiri wa Yahova kandi Saolo harara na vandu vosi va Isiraeli vasaangala ligali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
